   $q$Which is the factored form of $x^3 - 27$?$q$, $q$[{"text":"$(x - 3)(x^2 - 3x + 9)$","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-middle-sign"},{"text":"$(x - 3)(x^2 + 3x + 9)$","is_correct":true},{"text":"$(x - 3)^3$","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"cubed-the-binomial"},{"text":"$(x - 3)(x^2 + 6x + 9)$","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"doubled-middle-term"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$$(x - 3)(x^2 + 3x + 9)$$q$, $q$Use $a^3 - b^3 = (a - b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)$ with $a = x$ and $b = 3$ to get $(x - 3)(x^2 + 3x + 9)$. The choice with $-3x$ uses the middle sign from the sum of cubes pattern instead.$q$, 'draft', null)
