   $q$If $u = x^2$, the expression $x^4 - 7x^2 + 12$ can be rewritten as:$q$, $q$[{"text":"$2u - 7u + 12$","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"doubled-instead-of-squared"},{"text":"$u^2 - 7u^2 + 12$","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mis-substituted-middle-term"},{"text":"$u^2 - 7u + 12$","is_correct":true},{"text":"$u^4 - 7u^2 + 12$","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"substituted-u-for-x"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$$u^2 - 7u + 12$$q$, $q$Because $x^4 = (x^2)^2 = u^2$ and $x^2 = u$, the expression becomes $u^2 - 7u + 12$, a quadratic in $u$. Writing $u^4 - 7u^2 + 12$ replaces $x$ with $u$ instead of replacing $x^2$ with $u$.$q$, 'draft', null)
