   $q$What is the author's main point?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Barn owls have pale faces that many people think are beautiful.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Mice are the only problem that farmers have to worry about.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-evidence"},{"text":"Farmers should use poison to get rid of the mice in their barns.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Barn owls can help farmers by catching the mice on their farms.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Barn owls can help farmers by catching the mice on their farms.$q$, $q$The passage explains many ways owls help farmers with mice and ends by calling the owl "a best friend." The pale faces are an extra detail, not the main point.$q$, 'draft', '020df814-4c89-5f82-b161-6d50b43d7cdf')
